  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Promoting Economic Activities in Surkhandarya Region through Supporting Self-reliance of Vulnerable People including Afghan People</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to empower Afghan citizens and vulnerable Uzbek populations in Surkhandarya Region through vocational training, entrepreneurship support, and cross-border cooperation. It will modernize the Educational Center for Training Afghan Citizens (ECTAC) in Termez and utilize the Termez International Trade Center (TITC) to deliver short-term courses. By enhancing skills, providing equipment, and fostering inclusive economic opportunities, the initiative contributes to regional stability,</narrative>
  </description>
